 "remarks": "Experience elevated living at Park Tower Stamford, where luxury, convenience and captivating city views come together. Set on the 12th floor, this 2-bedroom, 2.5-bath residence offers approximately 1,677 square feet of light-filled living space, a versatile study and a private covered balcony. Floor-to-ceiling windows frame sweeping views of downtown, while rich hardwood floors and an open layout create an inviting setting for everyday living and entertaining. The spacious kitchen features granite countertops, dark wood cabinetry, stainless steel appliances and a generous island with seating. Just off the living area, the window-lined study is ideal for a home office or reading retreat, with access to the balcony. The primary suite offers a walk-in closet and marble bath with double vanity, soaking tub and separate glass-enclosed shower. A second bedroom, in-unit laundry and ample storage add comfort and flexibility. Enjoy full-service living with 24-hour concierge, indoor pool, fitness center, resident lounge and rooftop terrace. Across from Mill River Park and moments from dining, shopping, entertainment and Metro-North, this exceptional downtown address offers easy access to New York City, approximately 35 miles away. The best of Stamford and Manhattan are within easy reach.",
